  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.1.1: Ships XML documentation for the whole public API, so IntelliSense now works from the package. Corrects documentation that misstated the public API: DefaultExpiration applies only to HTTP response caching and is not a fallback for SetAsync or GetOrAddAsync, AddHealthChecks() is a required prerequisite, and MaxCacheableSize is reserved and not enforced. Logging paths use LoggerMessage delegates instead of ILogger extension calls. Quality gates enabled (TreatWarningsAsErrors, EnforceCodeStyleInBuild, latest-recommended). No public API was removed or renamed: every modified type is internal, and the shipped XML documentation is the user-facing addition, which is why this is a minor release.",
